input
Store Original
Store counter
Load Original
skipCond 0C00
Jump END
subt one
Store counter
Store counter2
Jump addLoop

//calculate the loop amount
addLoop, Load X //simulate mutlipcation through addition
add Original 
Store X
Load counter //update counters
subt one
Store counter
Load counter
skipCond 800 //repeat if needed
Jump Loop
Jump addLoop

//recongigs variables
Loop, Load X
Store Original //update original
Load ZERO
Store X //reset x
Load counter2
subt one //update counters
Store counter2
Store counter
skipcond 800 //repeat if needed
Jump END
Jump addLoop

END, Load Original
Output
Halt

//variables
counter, DEC 0
